---
import GardenLayout from '../layouts/GardenLayout.astro';
---

<!-- TODO: placeholder until the real manifesto is written -->
<GardenLayout title="How I Use AI" description="How and where AI shows up in my writing">
  <article class="prose">
    <header class="mb-12 not-prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-serif);">
        How I Use AI
      </h1>
    </header>

    <p>
      I often write by talking. Posts where AI was involved are labeled at the top with one of
      three levels: <em>transcribed</em> (AI turned my dictation into text),
      <em>supervised edit</em> (AI transcribed it and helped edit while I reviewed the changes),
      or <em>unsupervised edit</em> (AI transcribed it and edited it without my line-by-line
      review). Monthly linkposts use AI to summarize links, but the selection is mine.
    </p>

    <p>A fuller explanation is coming soon.</p>
  </article>
</GardenLayout>
